# Push fixed goldens to device

Whenever golden truth is **fixed or relabeled** under
`app/src/test/resources/golden/*.json` (or the matching on-device labels are
edited in the repo for sync):

1. **Push each changed JSON to the device in the same turn** — do not wait for
   the user to ask. Evaluate reads `filesDir/golden/` via `GoldenTruthStore`,
   not the repo copies.
2. Use platform-tools `adb` (often not on PATH):

```
$adb = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk\platform-tools\adb.exe"
$pkg = "com.personal.solitaireassistant"
# for each changed file:
& $adb push "app\src\test\resources\golden\<id>.json" "/data/local/tmp/<id>.json"
& $adb shell run-as $pkg cp "/data/local/tmp/<id>.json" "files/golden/<id>.json"
```

If `cp` fails, use the absolute redirect:

```
& $adb shell "run-as $pkg sh -c 'cat /data/local/tmp/<id>.json > /data/data/$pkg/files/golden/<id>.json'"
```

3. Confirm with `run-as … ls -l files/golden/<id>.json` (size should match the
   repo file). Say which ids were pushed.
4. Repo-only edits without a device push leave the next Evaluate scoring stale
   labels — treat that as incomplete work.
